🪨 BLOCK 1 — IDENTITY, BASELINE, AND RELEASE BOUNDARY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Product: RangeWater
- Proposed release: 1.2.0
- Proposed versionCode: 20
- Package identity: com.sagewire.rangewater — unchanged
- Proposed feature branch: codex/rw-tx-016-pmp
